OL,3,GNEWSAWork continues on 'vital' Castle
OL,4,ACornet breakwater
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssential long-term work on a
OL,7,Fbreakwater is set to continue over the
OL,8,Fcoming weeks.
OL,10,FGuernsey Ports said specialist
OL,11,Fcontractors would be carrying out
OL,12,Ffurther masonry repointing on the
OL,13,FCastle Cornet breakwater.
OL,15,FIt said it followed repointing work
OL,16,Flast year on the southern end of the
OL,17,Fbreakwater nearest the lighthouse,
OL,18,Fwhere the structure was exposed to the
OL,19,F"full force" of the weather and sea,
OL,20,Fwhere work would continue before the
OL,21,Fnorthern section was tackled.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
