OL,3,GNEWSAWork continues on 'vital' Castle
OL,4,ACornet breakwater
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoe Armstrong, Guernsey Ports project
OL,7,Fmanager said: "The Castle Breakwater
OL,8,Fplays a vital role in protecting St
OL,9,FPeter Port Harbour, so regular
OL,10,Finspections are essential to identify
OL,11,Fareas where preventative maintenance is
OL,12,Fneeded."
